.env
# public/session.json is intentionally NOT ignored any more. It no longer
# carries a credential -- the API key moved to a Vercel environment variable
# read only by api/gw/[...path].js -- and a static site has no build step, so
# the file has to be in the repo for the page to boot. If a session.json ever
# contains an apiKey again, that is a bug: the console refuses to run on one.
protean-gateway-public-key.pem
*.log
